#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:55
#: 3b2c52e2109941ec8396230dd2efff30
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:57
#: 4c80f6556010420fa8f9b2dee9fa7820
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default via the USART2 RX input. It supports all "
"serial RC protocols except PPM."
msgstr "遥控输入默认通过USART2 RX引脚配置，支持除PPM外的所有串行遥控协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:59
#: e8b2cc1b176c4d27a4958e1b861b2255
msgid ""
"Note: If the receiver is FPort the receiver must be tied to the USART2 TX "
"pin , RSSI_TYPE set to 3, and SERIAL2_OPTIONS must be set to 7 (invert "
"TX/RX, half duplex). For full duplex like CRSF/ELRS use both RX1 and TX1 and"
" set RSSI_TYPE also to 3."
msgstr ""
"注意：若接收机为FPort，则接收机必须连接到USART2 "
"TX引脚，RSSI_TYPE设置为3，SERIAL2_OPTIONS必须设置为7（反相TX/RX，半双工）。对于CRSF/ELRS等全双工协议，同时使用RX1和TX1，RSSI_TYPE也设置为3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:64
#: 915e4089012c43fa9c0ffe85d987885e
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:66
#: 6a2c809cc73345518dc342ccd87b71e4
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using an unused UART, such as the T3 pin (UART3"
" transmit). You need to set the following parameters to enable support for "
"FrSky S.PORT:"
msgstr "FrSky数传可通过未使用的UART支持，例如T3引脚（UART3发送）。要启用FrSky S.PORT支持，需设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:70
#: bf82dbfe76a94d2397b0f1d77862ea7e
msgid "SERIAL3_PROTOCOL 10"
msgstr "SERIAL3_PROTOCOL 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:71
#: 6b4e339b262c4ed491ee3d34b80a1e67
msgid "SERIAL3_OPTIONS 7"
msgstr "SERIAL3_OPTIONS 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:74
#: b9f66abc95884928ac3ac6ec3699774d
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:76
#: 472b89ba613c4ea4b56d78b71cf48604
msgid ""
"The Flywoo H743 Pro supports OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver) and "
"simultaneously DisplayPort using TX8/RX8 on the HD VTX connector."
msgstr ""
"Flywoo H743 Pro支持使用OSD_TYPE "
"1（MAX7456驱动）的OSD，同时在HD图传连接器的TX8/RX8上支持DisplayPort。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:79
#: 3edbea5fdebe487d9be0086d224b3806
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:81
#: 1e4e3d4947104f808beb4d11a9c37c5d
msgid ""
"The Flywoo H743 Pro supports up to 13 PWM or DShot outputs. The pads for "
"motor output M1 to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on "
"separate pads, plus M9-13 on a separate pads for LED strip and other PWM "
"outputs."
msgstr ""
"Flywoo H743 "
"Pro最多支持13路PWM或DShot输出。电机输出焊盘M1至M8同时在电机连接器和单独焊盘上提供，M9-13在单独焊盘上用于LED灯带和其他PWM输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:85
#: 65fb82c38a554701955de893ae7248ef
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM分为4组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:88
#: 2997aaadd1194287aec754abb9c9aaf1
msgid "PWM 1-2   in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-2 为第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:89
#: a4c0a73d0dbc433bbf57476d0778c64e
msgid "PWM 3-6   in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3-6 为第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:90
#: c30be6eff94e489d9fc1fc89cc07a4b7
msgid "PWM 7-10  in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7-10 为第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:91
#: 7fffa8270d7745ce910ca55179fbaf20
msgid "PWM 11-12 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 11-12 为第4组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:92
#: d2dffc6ab7f5418cbd6208f405795ed5
msgid "PWM 13    in group5"
msgstr "PWM 13 为第5组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:94
#: 21f126f7b95b4ec6be8ea4c5d1b002ad
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-10 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出频率。若某组内任一通道使用DShot，则该组所有通道均须使用DShot。通道1-10支持双向DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:99
#: b74a7e3a839a444fb8242b1d6454ee21
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:101
#: 9415fa7a92ec4eb08c08f22880512eb4
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor and external current sensor input. "
"The current sensor can read up to 130 Amps. The voltage sensor can handle up"
" to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "飞控板内置电压传感器和外部电流传感器输入。电流传感器最高可读130A。电压传感器最高支持6S锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:105
#: 5ef2bd6dd399481b93a219baa67456ce
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池参数设置为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:108
#: 94bd41b9828544ddad33812b864cb0c9
msgid "BATT_MONITOR 4"
msgstr "BATT_MONITOR 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:109
#: aaa22a75d61c49d5878de93efdc15119
msgid "BATT_VOLT_PIN 11"
msgstr "BATT_VOLT_PIN 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:110
#: ce80a75f0a7b43a6a02fdca417bad3fd
msgid "BATT_CURR_PIN 13"
msgstr "BATT_CURR_PIN 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:111
#: 4e20278db04c4395a15694f13f09cb08
msgid "BATT_VOLT_MULT 11.1"
msgstr "BATT_VOLT_MULT 11.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:112
#: 1c854ec42634477da1773f2af008b57d
msgid "BATT_AMP_PERVLT 40"
msgstr "BATT_AMP_PERVLT 40"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:115
#: e01a4f47476b43e6ab05351039b1a58b
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:117
#: c6134dbd4e7a417a9fe7b6bcd65b079a
msgid ""
"The Flywoo H743 Pro does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "Flywoo H743 Pro没有内置罗盘，但可通过SDA和SCL焊盘的I2C连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:120
#: 77e30554a3d54bbf9881786e32977833
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "图传电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:122
#: d2b9f76ef99f45ba8d5b06d3fff15aed
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"10V\". Setting this "
"GPIO low removes voltage supply to pins. By default RELAY2 is configured to "
"control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 81控制VTX BEC输出到标有「10V」的引脚。将此GPIO置低会切断引脚供电。默认情况下，RELAY2配置为控制此引脚并将GPIO置高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:126
#: 88e2d5e4046b4d95850529705047028d
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:128
#: 85050ba1ebae43cf922b282d1aa3212b
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"CAM1\" and "
"\"CAM2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video output from CAM1 to CAM2."
" By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO "
"82控制相机输出到标有「CAM1」和「CAM2」的连接器。将此GPIO置低会将视频输出从CAM1切换到CAM2。默认情况下，RELAY3配置为控制此引脚并将GPIO置高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:131
#: f3ebf8346e3b4f20a7a3faccfcbde530
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:133
#: f779be9a7007486cb258a6b453716d92
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:137
#: 048a6c5814a345c5b07798255acc9f1b
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用\\*.apj固件文件。"
